<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Cardel - Pricing</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0b0d12;
      --card: #131722;
      --text: #e6e8eb;
      --muted: #9aa3b2;
      --accent: #5b8cff;
      --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      --proTextA: #6e6c6c;
      --proTextB: #a2a2a2;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at top, #11162a, var(--bg));
      color: var(--text);
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .container {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 600px;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .accent {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .title__pro{
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--proTextA), var(--proTextB));
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
    }

    p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 30px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }

    .plan {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .price {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(91, 140, 255, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(91, 140, 255, 0.4);
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .features {
      text-align: left;
      margin-top: 20px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .coming-soon {
      margin-top: 40px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    a {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <h1><span class="title__pro">ACTIVE</span> — Coming Soon</h1>

    <p>
      We're currently working on introducing powerful premium features for Cardel.
      For now, you can enjoy the full experience with our free plan.
    </p>

    <div class="coming-soon">
      Paid plans with advanced features like WhatsApp/SMS alerts, cancellation link, complete automated subscriptions tracking are currently in development.
    </div>

  </div>

</body>
</html>